<title>USA: US weekly soybean crush 25,632,000 bushels -- NOPA.</title>
<headline>US weekly soybean crush 25,632,000 bushels -- NOPA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Oilseed Processors</p>
<p>Association weekly soybean crushings by reporting members</p>
<p>(crushings/capacity in bu, soymeal exports in short tons):</p>
<p>			 06/04/97    05/28/97	Year-Ago</p>
<p> Crushings	 25,632,000  25,462,000    23,695,000</p>
<p> Meal Exports	  44,158     132,586	     N/A</p>
<p> Capacity-X	35,451,000  35,451,000    34,100,000</p>
<p> Capacity-Y	35,643,944  35,643,944	     N/A</p>
<p>X-Members reporting weekly. Y-Weekly reporters plus members reporting only monthly. N/A-Not Available. Totals may not agree due to rounding by NOPA. R-revised</p>
<p>NOPA reported the following soybean crushings and capacity use by state for the week, with comparisons, in bushels:</p>
<p>    CRUSHINGS --   06/04/97    05/28/97     Year-Ago</p>
